    <string name="legal_privacy_content">When you search for a place, Open-Meteo receives the search term. Forecast requests send the coordinates of your selected place and reveal your IP address to Open-Meteo. The widget can refresh at the interval you select. The app does not use GPS. It stores favourites, settings, the selected place and the last forecast on your device. Clear these in the Android app settings. Provider information: https://open-meteo.com/en/terms</string>
